/'FDAC' SENDS DATA TO ONE OF EIGHT D/A CONVERTERS
/ CHANNEL NUMBERS 40-47(10) SCALE THE VALUE BY 4.

FDAC,   FIXIT           /GET CHANNEL NUMBER
        AND P7
        TAD (6570       /DEVICE CODE 57
        DCA DAC2
        TAD LORD
        AND M10         /0-7?
M140,   SZA CLA
        SP6             /'RTL' BITS
        TAD M1000
        DCA DAC1
        TSTCMA          /VALUE GIVEN?
XM20,   SNL SMA SZA CLA /NO
        GETNXT          /GET IT
DAC1,   NOP             /OR 'RTL'
DAC2,   NOP             /OUTPUT IT
        RETURN
/////
